    backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion fw:AC_S31 ;
    backlog:notYetScoreable true ;
    backlog:hasScoreabilityReason "Scored at epic level; scoring a decomposition child alongside its scored parent would double-count the parent's value, which the framework refuses." .
fw:AC_S31 a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ;
    backlog:hasGherkinText "Given an item worked partly by an agent and partly by a person, When its costs are recorded, Then token spend, environment cost and human minutes are each a named dimension carrying its own unit, and no dimension is assumed to be effort." .

